### Beauty Core 1.0 — Chat 36
### Backup Enterprise + Restore + LGPD + Disaster Recovery

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
@clienteId = COLE_CLIENTE_ID_AQUI

### Health básico
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health full com backup/recovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/full

### Status operacional de backup e recovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/backup/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Registrar/simular backup PostgreSQL
POST {{baseUrl}}/backup/executar/postgres
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Registrar/simular backup Uploads
POST {{baseUrl}}/backup/executar/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Registrar/simular backup completo
POST {{baseUrl}}/backup/executar/completo
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Executar limpeza operacional
POST {{baseUrl}}/backup/limpeza
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Exportação LGPD de cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/lgpd/exportar-cliente/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Anonimização LGPD de cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/lgpd/anonimizar-cliente/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
